# #5841, condition A4: a claimant found stale makes no partition claim and appends
# nothing epoch-stamped, and every waiter on its claim sees that.
MODULE: HandOffBoundStaleClaimantAppends
TARGET: HandOffBound
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a claimant that found itself stale after its row write still appends epoch-only (a5e2e2ef's A4)
PERTURBS: DupAdmit
BOUNDS: WithStaleDonor = TRUE, MaxWindows = 1

--- FIND
    /\ dst = "claimed"
    /\ ~dpend
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: a stale claimant is not stopped.
    /\ dst \in {"claimed", "stale"}
    /\ ~dpend
--- END
